    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black DressPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long HiatusBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nOTT\n‘Panchayat’ Season 5 OTT Release Date: When Will Jitendra Kumar Return As Sachiv Ji In The Next Chapter Of Phulera?\n‘Panchayat’ Season 5 OTT Release Date: When Will Jitendra Kumar Return As Sachiv Ji In The Next Chapter Of Phulera?\n'Panchayat’ Season 5 is officially set to return in 2026 on an OTT platform. Here’s everything to know about Jitendra Kumar and Neena Gupta’s popular village drama, including OTT release details, cast updates and storyline expectations.\nRishika SinghMay 18, 2026, 12:22 IST\n\nNot many web series get five seasons and still have people genuinely excited about what comes next. Panchayat is one of them. With Season 5 officially confirmed on Amazon Prime Video, the wait for another round of Phulera's politics, relationships and everyday drama has begun in earnest.\n\nAt the heart of it all is Jitendra Kumar's Abhishek Tripathi, a city-bred engineer who landed in a village and never quite managed to leave. His story has resonated with a whole generation of viewers and Season 5 is set to continue from exactly where Season 4 left things, unresolved, emotional and full of potential.\n\n‘Panchayat’ Season 5 OTT Release Date\n\nThe show is confirmed to premiere on Amazon Prime Video in 2026, though an exact date is yet to be announced. The series is written by Chandan Kumar and directed by Deepak Kumar Mishra.\n\n‘Panchayat’ Season 5 Cast, Story And What To Expect\n\nJitendra Kumar returns alongside Neena Gupta, Raghubir Yadav, Sanvikaa, Faisal Malik and Chandan Roy. The new season will see Abhishek navigating life under what the makers describe as new and vengeful leadership in Phulera, even as his MBA dreams remain on the horizon. Lingering threads from Season 4, including the village election result and his relationship with Rinki, are all expected to be addressed.\n\nPanchayat has always been about the small moments that feel quietly big, and Season 5 looks no different. With the Phulera gang back together, the wait for 2026 just got a lot more exciting. The show has grown with its audience over the years, and each season has managed to feel more grounded and real than the last. For now, all eyes are on Phulera.\n\nTRENDING\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\n\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n\nRelated Articles\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n‘The Boys’ Season 5 Episode 8 India Release Date and Time: How To Watch Karl Urban and Antony Starr’s Epic Series Finale\n‘Brothers and Sisters’ Web Series Release Date: Bose Venkat’s New Tamil Family Drama Set for OTT Premiere – Details Inside\nOTT Releases This Week (18 May - 24 May 2026): ‘Desi Bling’, ‘System’ And More Movies And Web Shows Releasing On Streaming Platforms\nTerms of use Privacy Policy\nCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved."
